<%# Scope chip (S3a T5, §9.3). A small faint label, then the control.

    It was the odd one out when the style settings were six pills and this was a
    select; on 27.08.2026 they became selects too, for the reason this one always
    was one: the browser's own control shows the chosen value and nothing else,
    and it handles a long list, the keyboard and touch without a line of
    JavaScript. Auto-submit is the established pattern here (meetings overview,
    time session groups).

    Since then this chip lives ABOVE the message field, in the row that says what
    the assistant is pointed at, while style and length stayed below it (see
    ChatContainerComponent's template for why). `contents` puts it into that
    row. %>
<div id="<%= dom_id %>" class="contents">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
    <span class="text-xs text-faint"><%= t('views.organisations.assistant_panels.scope.label') %></span>
    <%= form_with url: form_url, method: :patch,
                  data: { turbo_frame: 'assistant_panel_body', controller: 'auto-submit' },
                  class: 'contents' do |form| %>
      <%# text-xs explicitly: form controls do not inherit font-size, and
          @tailwindcss/forms sets them to 1rem -- without it the select towers over
          the style controls. focus:ring-0 for the same reason: the plugin's blue
          focus ring is the browser's language, not this app's.

          pe-7 leaves the plugin's own arrow the room it paints into: an even px
          override put the arrow straight on top of the project name. Wider than
          the 11rem it had, too -- since 27.08.2026 this row sits above the field
          on a line of its own instead of sharing one with six style pills, so a
          project name has somewhere to go. %>
      <%= form.select :scope_project_id,
                      options_from_collection_for_select(options, :id, :name, selected_project&.id),
                      { include_blank: t('views.organisations.assistant_panels.scope.all_projects') },
                      name: 'chat[scope_project_id]',
                      class: 'max-w-[14rem] truncate rounded-full border ps-2.5 pe-7 py-0.5 text-xs ' \
                             'transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 ' \
                             "#{selected_project ? 'border-ink bg-cream-200 text-cream-900 font-semibold' : 'border-cream-300 bg-cream-50 text-cream-700 hover:bg-cream-100 hover:border-cream-400'}",
                      aria: { label: t('views.organisations.assistant_panels.scope.aria_label') } %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
